Package: betwixt
Title: Scoped Semantic Claims and Human Review Workflows
Version: 0.0.4
Authors@R:
    person(
      given = "Daniel",
      family = "Antal",
      email = "daniel.antal@dataobservatory.eu",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7513-6760")
    )
Description: Provides a lightweight framework for expressing, reviewing, and
   documenting semantic claims in tabular data. Claims can be associated with
   review states and provenance and presented through configurable human review
   interfaces. The framework supports long and wide review projections while
   remaining compatible with existing data, metadata, and templating workflows.
URL: https://betwixt.dataobservatory.eu/
